  "rules_are_glob_like_covers_the_folder_and_everything_below_it_covers_the_folder_and_the_entries_directly_inside_it_and_a_plain_path_covers_only_the_folder_environment_variables_such_as_userprofile_are_expanded_first": "Rules are glob-like: ** covers the folder and everything below it, * covers the folder and the entries directly inside it, and a plain path covers only the folder. Environment variables such as %USERPROFILE% are expanded first.",
  "protected_path": "Protected path",
  "the_delete_button_in_the_protected_folder_dialog_stays_disabled_for_this_many_seconds_at_least_2": "The delete button in the protected-folder dialog stays disabled for this many seconds. At least 2.",
